                <pb facs="0921" n="859" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg859"/>

                <head>No. 506.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Maynard to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Cipher telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi> (<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Pera</hi>)</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1878-03-06"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 6, 1878</date>.<lb/>(Received
                        March 6, 1878—10.30 a.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Preliminaries of peace between Turkey and Russia signed at San Stefano on Sunday
                    last.</p>
                <closer><signed>MAYNARD</signed>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Pera.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
